<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<%- include('./../../common/header') %>

<head>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #000;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 584px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-bottom: 108px;
      background: #000;
    }

    /* ── 상단 바 ── */
    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      height: 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .topbar__title {
      color: #fff;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }
    .topbar__btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      height: 52px;
      width: 48px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }
    .topbar__btn--back { left: 4px; }
    .topbar__btn--heart { right: 4px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); }

    /* ── 히어로 (gif + 타이틀 오버레이) ── */
    .intro-hero {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      background: #000;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .intro-hero__gif {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .intro-hero__gradient {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      height: 62%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 35%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 62%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88) 84%,
        #000 100%
      );
    }

    .intro-hero__title {
      position: absolute;
      left: 22px;
      bottom: 22px;
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .intro-hero__year {
      display: block;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(20px, 6.5vw, 34px);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-style: italic;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .intro-hero__main {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 12.5vw, 66px);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.02;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    }

    /* ── 후기 ── */
    .reviews {
      padding: 22px 16px 4px;
    }
    .reviews__head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    .reviews__title {
      margin: 0;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .reviews__live {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e91e7a;
    }
    .reviews__dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e91e7a;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(233, 30, 122, 0.6);
      animation: rvpulse 1.6s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes rvpulse {
      0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(233, 30, 122, 0.55); }
      70%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(233, 30, 122, 0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(233, 30, 122, 0); }
    }

    .reviews {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
    .reviews__head {
      padding-right: 16px;
    }
    .reviews__scroll {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      padding: 2px 16px 2px 0;
      margin: 0;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      -ms-overflow-style: none;
    }
    .reviews__scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

    .rv-card {
      flex: 0 0 78%;
      max-width: 300px;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 15px 15px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 9px;
    }
    .rv-card__head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .rv-card__nick {
      color: #fff;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .rv-card__when {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .rv-card__stars {
      color: #e91e7a;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .rv-card__text {
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    /* ── 고정 CTA ── */
    .fixed-cta {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 584px;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      padding-bottom: calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
      background: linear-gradient(to top, #000 72%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));
    }

    .cta-btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      width: 100%;
      height: 56px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #e91e7a;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow:
        0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
        0 2px 10px rgba(233, 30, 122, 0.35);
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    .cta-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
      box-shadow:
        0 3px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
        0 1px 6px rgba(233, 30, 122, 0.3);
    }

    .cta-btn__arrow {
      font-size: 1.12em;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      margin-left: 2px;
    }

    .cta-btn__text {
      line-height: 1;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="topbar">
      <button type="button" class="topbar__btn topbar__btn--back" aria-label="뒤로" onclick="history.back()">&#8249;</button>
      <span class="topbar__title">월하점</span>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-hero">
      <img
        class="intro-hero__gif"
        src="/assets/images/tight/29/intro/0702.gif"
        alt="29금 속궁합 사주 인트로"
        width="584"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      >
      <div class="intro-hero__gradient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="intro-hero__title">
        <span class="intro-hero__year">2026</span>
        <h1 class="intro-hero__main">29금<br>속궁합 사주</h1>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="reviews">
      <div class="reviews__head">
        <h2 class="reviews__title">방금 올라온 후기</h2>
        <span class="reviews__live"><span class="reviews__dot"></span>실시간</span>
      </div>

      <div class="reviews__scroll">
        <article class="rv-card">
          <div class="rv-card__head">
            <span class="rv-card__nick">q***</span>
            <span class="rv-card__when">7일 전</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rv-card__stars" aria-label="5점">★★★★★</span>
          <p class="rv-card__text">별 기대 안 했는데… BDSM 맞추는 거 보고 이 정도면 해킹한 거 아니냐 싶었어요😳 한번쯤 재미삼아 봐도 좋을 거 같아요</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rv-card">
          <div class="rv-card__head">
            <span class="rv-card__nick">d***</span>
            <span class="rv-card__when">1일 전</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rv-card__stars" aria-label="5점">★★★★★</span>
          <p class="rv-card__text">미쳤다 완전 보수적인 사람이라 이런 거 관심 없었는데 이거 보고 완전 홀렸어요… 그 마음. 최고예욧🔥</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rv-card">
          <div class="rv-card__head">
            <span class="rv-card__nick">j***</span>
            <span class="rv-card__when">3시간 전</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rv-card__stars" aria-label="5점">★★★★★</span>
          <p class="rv-card__text">남친이랑 같이 봤는데 둘 다 얼굴 빨개져서 웃었어요ㅋㅋ 서로 뭘 좋아하는지 대화 트기 딱 좋더라고요</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rv-card">
          <div class="rv-card__head">
            <span class="rv-card__nick">s***</span>
            <span class="rv-card__when">6시간 전</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rv-card__stars" aria-label="5점">★★★★★</span>
          <p class="rv-card__text">솔직히 반신반의였는데 우리 케미 설명이 소름 돋게 맞아서… 캡처해서 바로 공유했어요. 디테일이 남달라요</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="fixed-cta">
    <a href="/saju/adult/input" class="cta-btn">
      <span class="cta-btn__text">비밀 속궁합 보러가기</span>
      <span class="cta-btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">--></span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <script>
    $(document).ready(function(){
      if(window.karrotPixel) window.karrotPixel.track('ViewContent');
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
